# Python bytecode. The mutation harnesses under crates/*/mutations are Python,
# and importing or running one writes __pycache__ beside it. A .pyc is a build
# artifact: binary, and specific to both the machine and the interpreter version
# that produced it. One was committed into an F3B2 candidate by a `git add -A`
# after the harness was imported for validation, which is exactly the class this
# closes.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Generated from notices/ by scripts/release/notices.py; never committed.
/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

